{"4699560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anomaly Sector", "steam_appid": 4699560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4801820], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699560/extras/3212e8a1d942705eab65a5765b3ea610.avif?t=1787163092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699560/extras_big/3212e8a1d942705eab65a5765b3ea610.webp?t=1787163092 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW MUCH DO YOU TRUST YOUR EYES—AND YOUR FRIENDS?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Sector</strong> is an online co-op game for 1-8 players.  <br>Spot anomalies, make the right decisions, and work together to clear every sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look carefully. </strong>One mistake, immidiate reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Anomaly Sector, you try to find anomalies and choose the correct way to go to the next sector. Sector 0 is the beginning, but the next sectors are where you should use your senses. If you spot an anomaly, go back. If not, move forward and use the Red and Green buttons. Memory is important in this game. Sometimes, there are bigger anomalies that players can immediately see and respond to, but sometimes there are anomalies that are hard to notice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699560/extras/46f2f45bbe3616fe8e024e627061afbb.avif?t=1787163092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699560/extras_big/46f2f45bbe3616fe8e024e627061afbb.webp?t=1787163092 width=1560 height=504 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious environments filled with hidden anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully observe your surroundings and make the correct decision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your friends, sometimes you miss they don't (Hopefully)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your memory, attention, and perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover anomalies ranging from obvious to nearly imperceptible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an immersive atmosphere enhanced by unsettling visuals and ambient sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699560/extras/ec10b941b0faccdd6710c46d8118390c.avif?t=1787163092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699560/extras_big/ec10b941b0faccdd6710c46d8118390c.webp?t=1787163092 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699560/extras/3212e8a1d942705eab65a5765b3ea610.avif?t=1787163092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699560/extras_big/3212e8a1d942705eab65a5765b3ea610.webp?t=1787163092 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW MUCH DO YOU TRUST YOUR EYES—AND YOUR FRIENDS?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Sector</strong> is an online co-op game for 1-8 players.  <br>Spot anomalies, make the right decisions, and work together to clear every sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look carefully. </strong>One mistake, immidiate reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Anomaly Sector, you try to find anomalies and choose the correct way to go to the next sector. Sector 0 is the beginning, but the next sectors 